title: CoresTraffickerEntry
---
<<if $numberOfCores > 0>>
    <<jump CoresTraffickerIntro>>
<<else>>
    <<jump TraffickerDismissal>>
<<endif>>
===

title: TraffickerDismissal
---
Fulmen: Hello, hello. Well, come on in. I'm Fulmen.
<<jump FulmenOfferingToBuy>>
===

title: FulmenOfferingToBuy
---
Fulmen: Do you have any Harvested Cores to sell to me? I'll buy any you have.
<<complete_objective DialogueCommands "VisitCoreTrader">>
-> No I haven't got any.
    <<if !$traffickerGaveJob001>>
        Fulmen: Alright. Come see me if you get some. You wouldn't be looking for work?
            -> No.
            -> Yes.
                <<jump OfferJobInChokedCaverns>>
    <<else>>
        Fulmen: Alright. Come see me if you get some.
    <<endif>>
-> Yes, I have some to sell.
    <<start_shopping_sell_illegal DialogueCommands "ShadyCoreTrafficker">>
    -> Alright, I'm done.
    <<stop_shopping_sell DialogueCommands "ShadyCoreTrafficker">>
    Fulmen: See ya round.
<<if !$fulmenDiscussedSister>>
-> I'm here to talk about my sister. (Show picture) 
    The scientist from Science Outpost 427 said you were her guide?
    <<if $completedRTGQuestForFulmen>>
        <<jump TalkToFulmenAboutSister>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump FulmenWantsFavorBeforeTalk>>
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
<<if !$traffickerGaveJob001>>
-> Actually, I'm looking for work..
    <<jump OfferJobInChokedCaverns>>
<<endif>>
===

title: FulmenOfferingToBuy002
---
Fulmen: Do you have any Harvested Cores to sell to me? I'll buy any you have.
-> No I haven't got any.
    Fulmen: Alright. Come see me if you get some.
    <<jump End02>>

-> Yes, I have some to sell.
    <<start_shopping_sell_illegal DialogueCommands "ShadyCoreTrafficker">>
    -> Alright, I'm done.
    <<stop_shopping_sell DialogueCommands "ShadyCoreTrafficker">>
    Fulmen: See ya round.
===

title: FulmenWantsFavorBeforeTalk
---
Fulmen: Yes, that is old history but I see you are concerned.
Fulmen: I'd like to help, but I'm not the charitable type, exactly.
Fulmen: I'd ask a favor and in return, I'd gladly tell you what I know.
<<jump OfferJobInChokedCaverns>>
===

title: TalkToFulmenAboutSister
---
Fulmen: Yes I was a guide of sorts back then.
Fulmen: Your sister, she'd been operating in the area a while, but knew little of the east.
Fulmen: She needed a guide who knew the caverns and mines in the areas east of here. 
Fulmen: She had very particular wishes and approached me for my discretion. I don't report my trips to the
Fulmen: planetary intelligence, never have, which is why I was sometimes sought by people hiding something.
Fulmen: She required absolute discretion and that I leave without her.
Fulmen: For a price, I could do the same for you.
-> Thanks, but I don't need a guide. I'm going to look around here a bit more. 
    (Playtest Doesn't Include Going where Fulmen Says to go)
    <<jump PlayerDemandsLocationOfDropoff>>
// -> How much?
//     <<jump PlayerAsksFulmenToGuide>>

===
title: PlayerDemandsLocationOfDropoff
---
Fulmen: Ok, not a problem.
===

title: PlayerAsksFulmenToGuide
---
Computer: End Playtest.
===

title: OfferJobInChokedCaverns
---
Fulmen: Sure, sure. I do have something.
Fulmen: I have a facility in the abandoned mine real close to here.
Fulmen: I need someone to replace the RTG that keeps the place running.
Fulmen: And I happen to know that down there are two valuable core groves.
Fulmen: Get them and harvest them in my facility.
Fulmen: Come back here. I'll reward you nicely for the Cores you find and the favor.
-> I will think about it.
    Fulmen: I'll be here if you change your mind.
-> Yes, count me in. 
    Fulmen: Excellent. 
    <<add_objective DialogueCommands "VisitAshpoolMine">>
    <<activate_objective DialogueCommands "VisitAshpoolMine">>
    <<add_objective DialogueCommands "InstallNewRTGInGenerator">>
    <<activate_objective DialogueCommands "InstallNewRTGInGenerator">>
    <<give_player_item DialogueCommands "RTGNuclearBattery" 1>>
    <<set $traffickerGaveJob001 = true>>
    -> Ok, I'll be off.
        Fulmen: Yeah, ok friend.
    -> Anything I should know?
        <<jump QuestionAboutChokedCaverns>>

===

title: QuestionAboutChokedCaverns
---
Fulmen: Yeah, it's pretty contaminated these days.
Fulmen: But not to worry! My facility has a decontamination tank.
Fulmen: Move fast and don't hang around, you'll be fine.
-> Thanks...
===

title: CoresTraffickerIntro
---
<<declare $trafficker_rep = 0>>
Fulmen: Hey, fella, how's the Minnas been treatin' you? I take it you know why you're here, talkin' to me, ya?
-> I know you traffic in illegal core harvests. I've come to shut you down for good.
    <<set $trafficker_rep = $trafficker_rep - 2>>
    <<jump PlayerThreatensTrafficker>>
-> Yeah, you deal in illegal alien Sheol AI cores? How do I know I can trust you?
    <<jump PlayerQuestionsTraffickerTrust>>
-> Yeah I'm here to get down to business.
Fulmen: You don't say... 
    <<scoffs>>
    <<initiate_trade>>
===

title: PlayerThreatensTrafficker

---
Fulmen: Is that so? Have you got some mercenary outfit behind you I'm not seeing?
Fulmen: You think I've survived doing what I do because some nobody sided with the Reds?
Fulmen: Don't make me laugh. You're either here to sell or you can fuck right off. 
-> Ok, yeah. Let's get this over with...
    // <<initiate_trade>>
===

title: PlayerQuestionsTraffickerTrust
---
Fulmen: You can't... I won't even pretend otherwise. I'll give you cash for your cores. 
Fulmen: The fuck did you expect, man? Think we were gonna be friends? Go talk to Clancy in that case.
Fulmen: So, you gonna keep wasting my time or you gonna sell me your cores?
-> Yeah, let's trade.
    <<initiate_trade>>
-> Nevermind... I'll just be going.
// End of dialogue
===